Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:41.22,Hook,,0,0,0,,GTA 6 NUNCA SE ACABA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}«¿Ya vas en un tercio?»
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:02.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Claro que no, carajo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:03.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Espera... ¿o sí?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Ya llevo un tercio del\Njuego?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:09.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Espera, voy en 33%... ¡sí!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.68,0:00:12.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Pero apenas voy en el\Ncapítulo dos,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.82,0:00:13.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}y se supone que son cinco.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:16.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No lo entiendo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:19.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Bueno, chat, ¿qué creen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:20.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿En qué porcentaje vamos?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.10,0:00:23.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}A ver, díganme qué creen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:25.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿En qué porcentaje vamos\Nahorita?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:27.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿40? Ni de broma.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:29.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}34...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.54,0:00:31.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}34...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.94,0:00:33.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}34.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:37.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Subí 1% en como dos horas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.46,0:00:41.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}De verdad que no puede\Nser.
